{"id":"ba2bba4865252dc0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-lem-diamond-equivalent.md","title":"Diamond Equivalent","display":"lem-diamond-equivalent — Diamond Equivalent","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-diamond-equivalent","aliases":["58-lem-diamond-equivalent"],"display":"lem-diamond-equivalent — Diamond Equivalent","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-diamond-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-diamond-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-diamond-equivalent — Diamond Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\)</span>（diamond 原理，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\)</span>（平稳集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\to\\Biggl(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\langle A_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\;\\Bigl[\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa:X\\cap\\alpha=A_\\alpha\\},\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\to\\Biggl(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\langle A_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\;\\Bigl[\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa:X\\cap\\alpha=A_\\alpha\\},\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 diamond 定义的序列形式展开；条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha\">\\(A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha\\)</span> 不能省略。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> 蕴含 CH，但该推论不是本等价式的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)$（正则基数谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\diamondsuit_\\kappa$（diamond 原理，见 [[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)$（平稳集谓词，见 [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diamond\\t